      "summaries": {
        "en": "AI-Trader is a fully-automated, agent-native trading system that uses large language models to make investment decisions without human intervention. Its core innovation is an agent-based architecture where LLMs analyze market data, news, and technical indicators to generate trades. The system supports multiple strategies and can be backtested or deployed live. Developers can extend it by integrating custom data sources or trading algorithms, making it ideal for experimenting with AI-driven quantitative finance.",
        "zh": "AI-Trader 是一个全自动智能交易系统，核心利用大语言模型作为交易代理，自主分析市场数据、新闻和技术指标，无需人工干预即可执行投资决策。技术亮点在于基于代理的架构，将LLM与金融数据管道深度集成，支持多策略并行运行。开发者可使用内置回测框架验证策略，或通过插件机制接入自定义数据源与交易算法。该项目适合对AI量化交易感兴趣的开发者，用于研究LLM在金融决策中的潜力或快速搭建个人自动化交易实验平台。",
        "es": "AI-Trader is a fully-automated, agent-native trading system that uses large language models to make investment decisions without human intervention. Its core innovation is an agent-based architecture where LLMs analyze market data, news, and technical indicators to generate trades. The system supports multiple strategies and can be backtested or deployed live. Developers can extend it by integrating custom data sources or trading algorithms, making it ideal for experimenting with AI-driven quantitative finance.",
        "sections": {
