          "what": "AI-Trader is a fully-automated, agent-native trading system that uses large language models to make investment decisions without human intervention. Its core innovation is an agent-based architecture where LLMs analyze market data, news, and technical indicators to generate trades. The system supports multiple strategies and can be backtested or deployed live. Developers can extend it by integrating custom data sources or trading algorithms, making it ideal for experimenting with AI-driven quantitative finance.",
