        "en": "CloakBrowser is a stealth Chromium browser designed to evade bot detection systems like Cloudflare. It patches browser fingerprinting at the source level, making automated scripts indistinguishable from human users. As a drop-in replacement for Playwright, it passes 30/30 detection tests. Developers can integrate it into web scraping or testing workflows to bypass anti-bot measures without sacrificing reliability.",
        "zh": "CloakBrowser 是一款经过深度改造的 Chromium 浏览器，专门用于绕过 Cloudflare 等反爬虫系统的检测。其核心创新在于从源码层面修补浏览器指纹特征，使自动化脚本的行为与真实用户无异。作为 Playwright 的直接替代品，它通过了全部 30 项检测测试。开发者只需将现有 Playwright 代码中的浏览器启动命令替换为 CloakBrowser，即可在网页抓取、自动化测试等场景中有效规避反机器人机制，同时保持操作的高可靠性和低维护成本。",
        "es": "CloakBrowser is a stealth Chromium browser designed to evade bot detection systems like Cloudflare. It patches browser fingerprinting at the source level, making automated scripts indistinguishable from human users. As a drop-in replacement for Playwright, it passes 30/30 detection tests. Developers can integrate it into web scraping or testing workflows to bypass anti-bot measures without sacrificing reliability.",
        "sections": {
