        "es": "Flutter Skills is a collection of hands-on coding exercises for learning Flutter and Dart. It solves the problem of bridging theory and practice by providing structured, real-world tasks. Technically, it emphasizes incremental learning, with each skill building on previous ones, covering widgets, state management, and platform integration. Developers can clone the repo, follow the skill progression, and modify exercises to test their understanding. Ideal for self-learners or workshop facilitators seeking practical, project-based Flutter training.",
