      "summaries": {
        "en": "Qwen3.6-27B-FP8 is a 27-billion-parameter multimodal model that processes both images and text, enabling conversational AI with visual understanding. Its key innovation is FP8 quantization, which reduces memory and compute requirements while preserving most of the original model's accuracy. This makes it practical for deployment on resource-constrained hardware like consumer GPUs. You can use it for tasks such as image captioning, visual question answering, or document analysis by loading it with Hugging Face Transformers and running inference on a single GPU with 24GB+ VRAM.",
        "zh": "Qwen3.6-27B-FP8是一个270亿参数的多模态大模型，可同时理解图像与文本，实现视觉对话。其核心技术为FP8量化，将模型权重从16位压缩至8位，显著降低显存与计算需求，同时保持大部分原始精度。用户可在消费级GPU（如RTX 4090）上运行，无需昂贵服务器集群。通过Hugging Face Transformers库加载模型，输入图片与问题即可获得图文相关回答，适用于图像描述、视觉问答、文档分析等任务。建议使用24GB以上显存显卡进行本地部署。",
